{title: Shut In With God}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Shut in with God in a [G]secret place;
[D]There in the Spirit be[G]holding His face;
[D]Gaining more Power to [G]run in the race,
I [D]love to be [A]shut in with [D]God.

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]Shut in with God while [G]kneeling in prayer,
[D]Finding His Beauty and [G]Glory there.
[D]I bow in wonder at His [G]awesome Grace,
As [D]He shuts [A]me in His Holy [D]place.

{comment: Verse 3}
[D]As I'm shut in with God, [G]my strenght is renewed,
[D]I soar like a eagle, [G]I'm born anew.
[D]O the wonder! O the [G]Grace!
As [D]I'm shut in [A]with God in this Holy [D]place!
